sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Indoor Object Detection & Distance
    
    actor Blind User
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant AI as Vision Engine
    participant Depth as Distance Calc
    participant TTS as Feedback Service

    Note over Cam, TTS: Continuous Scanning Mode

    loop Every Frame
        Cam->>AI: Stream RGB Frame
        AI->>AI: Detect Objects (YOLO)
        AI-->>Depth: Bounding Box Coordinates
        
        activate Depth
        Depth->>Depth: Calculate Distance (e.g., based on box height)
        Depth-->>TTS: Object: "Chair", Distance: "2 meters"
        deactivate Depth
        
        TTS->>Blind User: "Chair, 2 meters ahead"
    end
